    {
      "id": "ui-salary-half-leave-tag",
      "name": "API + UI – A paid half day of leave on a salaried date with no work is paid half a day and raises the amber \"חצי יום חופשה בלי שעות\" tag",
      "description": "A salaried employee works all seven days. A paid half day of leave on the sixth of last month, with no lesson and no hours that day, is paid half a day of salary. The \"כספים\" table shows the amber tag with the count; in the employee's summary there is no separate exception section: the half day's own line under \"חופשה\" carries the same words in amber and shows the deduction (\"−₪...\", \"חצי יום לא שולם\") where a covered day says \"כלול במשכורת\".",
      "steps": [
        {
